    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;In this final moment, our hopes, fears and uncertainties come together in action.  We'd joke that there's no going back now, but that's really the point, isn't it?&quot;</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With those fateful words, you join the team of Hope Labs. A group of scientists &amp; engineers, setting out to change the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Except, it all goes wrong. And now the team needs to band together, to fix the machine, to get back to normal, to before it all broke... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399540/extras/41a8b0c3245a9d55918022813da58ea2.poster.avif?t=1752313546\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399540/extras/41a8b0c3245a9d55918022813da58ea2.webm?t=1752313546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399540/extras/41a8b0c3245a9d55918022813da58ea2.mp4?t=1752313546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Forgetful Loop is a worker-placement time puzzle game, where you and the team of 14 scientists/engineers are trying to fix a time-machine gone broken! Every second counts as the clock ticks to zero. But when it does, not all progress is lost! Can we fix the machine?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399540/extras/3da4c2d5badae9f1563456a6dce98a53.avif?t=1752313546\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About <strong>6-8 Hours</strong> of content, with 7 main groups and 2 new groups with the 2025 update.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>59 Achievements</strong> to chase, with some tricky ones to challenge your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls</strong>: Keyboard and Mouse controls, with rebinding support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399540/extras/b4c0b697381a6a3938efa6059d073580.avif?t=1752313546\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Jennifer, Isabel, whatever's happening with you, I'm sorry -&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;- but we've only got seconds until we loop again.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;If you remember this conversation... help us fix the machine!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The loop restarts again.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;In this final moment, our hopes, fears and uncertainties come together in action.  We'd joke that there's no going back now, but that's really the point, isn't it?&quot;</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With those fateful words, you join the team of Hope Labs. A group of scientists &amp; engineers, setting out to change the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Except, it all goes wrong. And now the team needs to band together, to fix the machine, to get back to normal, to before it all broke... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399540/extras/41a8b0c3245a9d55918022813da58ea2.poster.avif?t=1752313546\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399540/extras/41a8b0c3245a9d55918022813da58ea2.webm?t=1752313546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399540/extras/41a8b0c3245a9d55918022813da58ea2.mp4?t=1752313546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Forgetful Loop is a worker-placement time puzzle game, where you and the team of 14 scientists/engineers are trying to fix a time-machine gone broken! Every second counts as the clock ticks to zero. But when it does, not all progress is lost! Can we fix the machine?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399540/extras/3da4c2d5badae9f1563456a6dce98a53.avif?t=1752313546\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About <strong>6-8 Hours</strong> of content, with 7 main groups and 2 new groups with the 2025 update.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>59 Achievements</strong> to chase, with some tricky ones to challenge your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls</strong>: Keyboard and Mouse controls, with rebinding support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399540/extras/b4c0b697381a6a3938efa6059d073580.avif?t=1752313546\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Jennifer, Isabel, whatever's happening with you, I'm sorry -&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;- but we've only got seconds until we loop again.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;If you remember this conversation... help us fix the machine!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The loop restarts again.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "A Forgetful Loop is a time-based worker-placement puzzle game, where you need to weigh up which nodes are more important at a given moment; To get closer to the core, closer to the finish line!",
